---

<section id="pillars" class="py-section bg-bg" aria-labelledby="pillars-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[0.72rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-accent mb-5 before:w-5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="pillars.label">What We Do</div>
      <h2 class="section-title text-white text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.8rem)] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4" id="pillars-heading" data-i18n="pillars.title">Three pillars.<br>One cohesive system.</h2>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-2 max-w-[520px] leading-relaxed" data-i18n="pillars.sub">Every engagement covers what actually moves the needle — nothing else.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <article class="bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-[20px] p-10 transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden hover:border-[rgba(139,92,246,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-accent before:absolute before:top-0 before:left-0 before:right-0 before:h-0.5 before:bg-gradient-to-r before:from-accent before:to-accent-2 before:opacity-0 before:transition-all before:duration-300 hover:before:opacity-100 reveal" aria-labelledby="pillar-1-title">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[rgba(115,96,248,0.15)] border border-[rgba(139,92,246,0.2)] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-7 text-accent-light">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2" id="pillar-1-title" data-i18n="pillars.p1.title">Brand &amp; Packaging</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-2 mb-6 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="pillars.p1.desc">Identity that earns attention before a single word is read.</p>
        <ul class="list-none mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2.5" role="list">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p1.item1">Brand identity systems</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p1.item2">Packaging design</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p1.item3">Product storytelling</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p1.item4">Visual systems &amp; guidelines</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#cta" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-display text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider border cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap transition-all duration-300 bg-transparent text-white border-border hover:border-accent hover:text-accent-light hover:bg-[rgba(115,96,248,0.15)] hover:-translate-y-px text-xs" data-i18n="pillars.cta">Start a Project</a>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-[20px] p-10 transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden hover:border-[rgba(139,92,246,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-accent before:absolute before:top-0 before:left-0 before:right-0 before:h-0.5 before:bg-gradient-to-r before:from-accent before:to-accent-2 before:opacity-0 before:transition-all before:duration-300 hover:before:opacity-100 reveal reveal-delay-1" aria-labelledby="pillar-2-title">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[rgba(115,96,248,0.15)] border border-[rgba(139,92,246,0.2)] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-7 text-accent-light">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2" id="pillar-2-title" data-i18n="pillars.p2.title">Ecommerce Engineering</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-2 mb-6 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="pillars.p2.desc">Stores built to convert — not just to exist.</p>
        <ul class="list-none mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2.5" role="list">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p2.item1">Shopify &amp; WooCommerce builds</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p2.item2">High-converting PDP systems</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p2.item3">Pixel &amp; analytics setup (Meta, GA4, TikTok)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p2.item4">Performance &amp; SEO foundation</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#cta" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-display text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider border cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap transition-all duration-300 bg-transparent text-white border-border hover:border-accent hover:text-accent-light hover:bg-[rgba(115,96,248,0.15)] hover:-translate-y-px text-xs" data-i18n="pillars.cta">Start a Project</a>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-[20px] p-10 transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden hover:border-[rgba(139,92,246,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-accent before:absolute before:top-0 before:left-0 before:right-0 before:h-0.5 before:bg-gradient-to-r before:from-accent before:to-accent-2 before:opacity-0 before:transition-all before:duration-300 hover:before:opacity-100 reveal reveal-delay-2" aria-labelledby="pillar-3-title">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[rgba(115,96,248,0.15)] border border-[rgba(139,92,246,0.2)] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-7 text-accent-light">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2" id="pillar-3-title" data-i18n="pillars.p3.title">Growth Systems</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-2 mb-6 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="pillars.p3.desc">The infrastructure that compounds revenue over time.</p>
        <ul class="list-none mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2.5" role="list">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p3.item1">Email &amp; SMS flows</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p3.item2">Post-purchase optimization</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p3.item3">Loyalty &amp; referral systems</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p3.item4">Affiliate infrastructure</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-1 font-medium before:w-1 before:h-1 before:bg-accent before:rounded-full before:shrink-0" data-i18n="pillars.p3.item5">CRO sprints</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#cta" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-display text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider border cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap transition-all duration-300 bg-transparent text-white border-border hover:border-accent hover:text-accent-light hover:bg-[rgba(115,96,248,0.15)] hover:-translate-y-px text-xs" data-i18n="pillars.cta">Start a Project</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
